WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.537
A ticket to Lille, please.

00:00:02.787 --> 00:00:04.847
One way or return?

00:00:05.097 --> 00:00:07.342
One way for tomorrow morning.

00:00:07.592 --> 00:00:10.338
The train leaves at nine, platform three.

00:00:10.588 --> 00:00:13.489
At nine, platform three. Thank you.
